interface.longDescription:
Run creator marketing campaigns on Noise from ChatGPT. Noise is a creator marketing platform: brands brief creators, and creators post about the brand's product on TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, Facebook and Snapchat.

With this plugin a brand on Noise can:
- check what their brand still needs before its campaigns go live;
- set up and change campaigns: content format, which creators can post, and where;
- build playbooks (the brief creators follow) as slideshows or UGC video scripts, add reference videos and publish them;
- turn campaigns and playbooks on or off;
- read daily campaign performance, creator posts and the change history.

It requires a Noise brand account; sign in with the email you use for the Noise brand portal. Each change has a preview, and ChatGPT asks before making it. Account settings are managed in the Noise brand portal. The plugin only reaches the brands your account belongs to.
